BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Global Forum: Lyd Film Screening
DTSTART:20261105T010000Z
DTEND:20261105T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261030T123107Z
UID:localist-54295235563481-54295235564506@ucsd-grad-calendar
CATEGORIES:ISEO (iEvents)
DESCRIPTION:Join International House for a screening and discussion of Lyd
 : A Sci-Fi Documentary on Wednesday\, November 4th from 5pm-7pm in the Gre
 at Hall. \n\nFrom directors\, Rami Younis and Sarah Ema Friedland\, this f
 eature-length\, sci-fi documentary shares multiple pasts\, presents\, and 
 futures of the city of Lyd. From the perspective of the city herself\, voi
 ced by Palestinian actress Maisa Abd Elhadi\, the viewer is guided through
  the lifespan of a five-thousand-year-old city and its residents. Lyd was 
 once a thriving Palestinian city with a rich history. In 636 AD\, it was e
 ven considered the first…\n\nSource: ISEO (iEvents)\n\nhttps://calendar.
 ucsd.edu/event/global-forum-lyd-film-screening
LOCATION:Great Hall
URL:https://calendar.ucsd.edu/event/global-forum-lyd-film-screening
END:VEVENT
